#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:296
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:298
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 2` maps the model to two NPUs. Increase TP only "
"after validating memory, communication, and throughput on your hardware."
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size 2` 将模型映射到两个 NPU。仅在验证了硬件上的内存、通信和吞吐量之后，再增加 TP。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:299
msgid ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not"
" mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。不要在同一个 MoE 层中混合使用 MoE 张量并行和专家并行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:300
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len` is the maximum input plus output length for a single "
"request. By default, the model can support long context, but `128000` is a "
"practical validation value for many image/video workloads."
msgstr ""
"`--max-model-len` 是单个请求的最大输入加输出长度。默认情况下，模型可以支持长上下文，但 `128000` "
"是许多图像/视频工作负载的实用验证值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:301
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` is the maximum number of active requests scheduled by each "
"DP group. Video requests consume more memory, so the video example uses a "
"smaller value."
msgstr "`--max-num-seqs` 是每个 DP 组调度的最大活跃请求数。视频请求消耗更多内存，因此视频示例使用了较小的值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:302
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one "
"scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes "
"more activation memory."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` 是单个调度步骤中处理的最大 token 数。较大的值可以提高 prefill "
"效率，但会消耗更多的激活内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:303
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` controls how much HBM vLLM can use to calculate "
"KV cache capacity. Increase it only after confirming the service is stable."
msgstr ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` 控制 vLLM 可用于计算 KV 缓存容量的 HBM 量。仅在确认服务稳定后增加此值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:304
msgid ""
"`--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0` disables video inputs and saves memory for "
"image-only serving."
msgstr "`--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0` 禁用视频输入，为纯图像服务节省内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:305
msgid ""
"`--allowed-local-media-path /media` allows requests to use local files such "
"as `file:///media/test.mp4`."
msgstr ""
"`--allowed-local-media-path /media` 允许请求使用本地文件，例如 `file:///media/test.mp4`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:306
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables "
"full decode ACLGraph replay to reduce dispatch overhead."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 启用完整的 "
"decode ACLGraph 重放以减少调度开销。"

