#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:435
msgid "9.2.2 Recommended tuning order"
msgstr "9.2.2 推荐调优顺序"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:437
msgid ""
"Start from image-only serving. Add video only after the image path is "
"stable."
msgstr "从纯图像服务开始。仅在图像路径稳定后再添加视频。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:438
msgid ""
"Choose the maximum context length with `--max-model-len`. Multimodal "
"requests consume KV cache for both text tokens and visual tokens, so reduce "
"image resolution, video length, request concurrency, or context length if "
"OOM occurs."
msgstr ""
"使用`--max-model-"
"len`选择最大上下文长度。多模态请求会同时消耗文本令牌和视觉令牌的KV缓存，因此如果发生OOM，请降低图像分辨率、视频长度、请求并发数或上下文长度。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:439
msgid ""
"Tune multimodal limits. Use `--limit-mm-per-prompt.image` and `--limit-mm-"
"per-prompt.video` to match your request shape."
msgstr ""
"调整多模态限制。使用`--limit-mm-per-prompt.image`和`--limit-mm-per-"
"prompt.video`来匹配您的请求形态。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:440
msgid ""
"Tune `--max-num-batched-tokens`. Larger values usually improve prefill "
"throughput but increase activation memory. Video-heavy workloads usually "
"need conservative values."
msgstr ""
"调整`--max-num-batched-tokens`。较大的值通常能提高预填充吞吐量，但会增加激活内存。视频密集型工作负载通常需要保守的值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:441
msgid ""
"Tune `--max-num-seqs` according to service concurrency. Video requests are "
"more memory intensive than image requests, so start with a smaller value."
msgstr "根据服务并发数调整`--max-num-seqs`。视频请求比图像请求更消耗内存，因此请从较小的值开始。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:442
msgid ""
"Tune `--gpu-memory-utilization`. Increase it to provide more KV cache, but "
"leave headroom for runtime memory fluctuation and media preprocessing."
msgstr "调整`--gpu-memory-utilization`。增加该值以提供更多KV缓存，但需为运行时内存波动和媒体预处理预留空间。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct.md:443
msgid ""
"Tune ACLGraph capture. `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` is recommended for decode. If you "
"set `cudagraph_capture_sizes` manually, include common decode batch sizes."
msgstr ""
"调整ACLGraph捕获。解码推荐使用`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`。如果手动设置`cudagraph_capture_sizes`，请包含常见的解码批量大小。"

